  description: 'Slash Damage + Slightly increases the more you use it multiple times
    in a row

    Damage (if applicable): Base power = 1.0 (around 40 base Power)

    This
    Ability slowly increases power the more the player keeps selecting it. The Power
    gets increased by .5. For example: Since the Base Power is 1.0 and the player
    uses Trimming the first time, when the player selects the ability again the power
    will become 1.5.'
